cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the article from preferred-citation and this software itself."
type: software
title: "q-krylov-subspace-diagonalization"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation for the paper "Quantum Krylov Subspace
  Diagonalization via Time Reversal Symmetries". Krylov Time Reversal
  (KTR) is a protocol for quantum Krylov subspace diagonalization that
  avoids controlled unitaries by exploiting a time-reversal symmetry
  of the Hamiltonian dynamics.
